'''Red EnerG''' (レッド・エナG ''Reddo EnaG'', '''Red EnaG''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[H. Nah]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]].

