==Trivia==
*Until [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]], Red EnerG's name was styled as [Red EnerG] in the [[Enemy Guide]]. This may have been a leftover from [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]]'s Enemy Guide, which puts all enemies' names inside brackets.
*Red EnerG's Japanese name, Red EnaG, is a play on ''red energy'' and ''(hy)ena'', as well as [[H. Nah]]'s Japanese name, "High Energy" (ハイ・エナジー).
*Red EnerG's Japanese description plays off of how the "hy" in ''hyena'' sounds like ''high'' (euphoria from alcohol or drugs).
*Just like how H. Nah is a parody of [[wikia:lionking:Ed|Ed]], Red EnerG's hairstyle may be a reference to the hyena [[wikia:lionking:Shenzi|Shenzi]] from ''The Lion King''.

